   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PFD201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 7 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13364 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PFD201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>7 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13364 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Understand the history and theory of photography, the relationship between photography and visual disciplines, and its influence on culture.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Understand both advanced digital and analog camera operations with the understanding of formats, exposure in photography, depth of field, shutter speed, and illustrate proper placement of plane of focus.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Illustration of advanced visual literacy skills by utilizing sophisticated compositional properties and visual qualities of a photographic image</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Demonstrate the ability to recognize and control both natural and studio lighting with emphasis on the quality, quantity, direction of light and the resulting effect of light on the photographic image, and ability to determine what type of studio lighting equipment is necessary to properly light various types of objects, people, spaces, and locations.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Manipulate, manage, archive digital images and control the transition of image color, tone and value from screen to printed image.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Organize, edit, and evaluate a professional quality portfolio of photographic work that demonstrates creative problem solving skill and effective communication.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Having a positive attitude and a professional working style</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
