   "type": "DOCUMENT",
   "isFreePreview": true,
   "description": "Khung môn học theo syllabus FLM chính thức.",
   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PFD201 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.6</span>\n<h2>Student tasks & constructive questions</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">The rules you are held to (attendance, preparation, exam eligibility) — verbatim.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13364 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PFD201 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.6</span>\n<h2>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên & câu hỏi kiến tạo</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Những quy định bạn phải tuân theo (chuyên cần, chuẩn bị bài, điều kiện dự thi) — nguyên văn.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13364 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Student tasks (verbatim)</h3>\n<p>'- Students must attend at least 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.<br>- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time.<br>- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose.<br>- Promptly access to the FLM at <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a> for up-to-date course information.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Nhiệm vụ sinh viên (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<p>'- Students must attend at least 80% of contact slots in order to be accepted to the final examination.<br>- Student is responsible to do all exercises, assignments and labs given by instructor in class or at home and submit on time.<br>- Use laptop in class only for learning purpose.<br>- Promptly access to the FLM at <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/</a> for up-to-date course information.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Constructive questions (31)</h3>\n<p>Questions the syllabus asks you to think through before or during the session — try answering them yourself first.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Câu hỏi kiến tạo (31)</h3>\n<p>Câu hỏi syllabus yêu cầu bạn suy nghĩ trước/trong buổi học — tự trả lời trước khi xem bài.</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>Session<br><small>Buổi</small></th><th>Code<br><small>Mã</small></th><th>Question (verbatim)<br><small>Câu hỏi (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td>QN2.1</td><td>What is the Art of Photography? Distinguish the difference between the art of photography and the art of painting?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>QN3.1</td><td>How many major styles are there in the art of photography worldwide?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td>QN3.2</td><td>How many major periods in the history of world photography are there?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>QN4.1</td><td>Is it necessary to put content or meaning into the photo?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td>QN4.2</td><td>How many main directions of light are there in photography?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td>QN5.1</td><td>In Vietnamese, what do the names &quot;Nhiep Anh Gia&quot; and &quot;Tho Chup Anh&quot; mean? Distinguish between &quot;Nhiep Anh Gia&quot; and &quot;Tho Chup Anh&quot;?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td>QN6.1</td><td>How many influential photographers do you know around the world?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td>QN7.1</td><td>Difference between DSLR and SLR cameras?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td>QN8.1</td><td>Why are digital cameras more commonly used than film cameras?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td>QN9.1</td><td>What important accessories does a professional photographer need?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td>QN10.1</td><td>What is a DSLR camera? How to identify a DSLR camera?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td>QN11.1</td><td>How does a DSLR camera work?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td>QN12.1</td><td>What and how should you use DSLR camera modes?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td>QN13.1</td><td>What is the relationship between Aperture, Shutter speed and ISO?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>14</td><td>QN14.1</td><td>How to avoid taking too dark or light photos on camera?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>15</td><td>QN15.1</td><td>What is camera Exposure? How to set Exposure on a camera?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>16</td><td>QN16.1</td><td>RAW vs JPEG - Which image format is better and why?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>17</td><td>QN17.1</td><td>What is the main factor affecting the depth of field?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>18</td><td>QN18.1</td><td>Why are your photos blurry and how to avoid it?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>19</td><td>QN19.1</td><td>How do you capture nice light for an object that moves a lot?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>20</td><td>QN20.1</td><td>What photography studio lighting is the best?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>21</td><td>QN21.1</td><td>What is the difference between studio light and natural light?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>25</td><td>QN25.1</td><td>What skills are required to use personal camera &amp; lens, smartphones with DSLR control?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>26</td><td>QN26.1</td><td>How can one do classification in photography? What about street photography?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>27</td><td>QN27.1</td><td>How To Do Street Photography? What cameras and equipment? Tips?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>37</td><td>QN37.1</td><td>Why is colour grading important?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>38</td><td>QN38.1</td><td>Mistakes when starting to image Editing?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>39</td><td>QN39.1</td><td>How do you thoughts when edit image?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>49</td><td>QN49.3</td><td>What is a good photo?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>50</td><td>QN50.1</td><td>How do you use photos to speak to different audiences?</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>51</td><td>QN51.1</td><td>How do you inspire your audience with the photos you take?</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13364</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
